              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gano ngo amarëma gano Abhaisiraeri bhaatuenanibhöë gönsë ya Kanaani. Ereasari umunchaama na Yosua, ömoona o Nuni, hamui na abhatangati bhi ichika chi ibhiaro bhia Abhaisiraeri mbo bhatueneeye Abhaisiraeri amarema ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
